  <History Date="18-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches.  Added product thumbnail.  Standardised colour functions." />
  <History Date="18-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added colour function index.  Fixed gobo function index." />
